TEST T47873 -- VRRP(v3)
================================================================================
Run:      2026-10-16 18:56-19:25 NZDT. The devices' clocks read UTC and were
          measured against the box at the group gate -- the DUT 05:16:33 UTC
          against the box's 05:16:51, swi_b 05:20:08 against the box's 05:20:18
          -- both inside console round-trip latency, so device times and box
