Bench:    tb277, consoles u2 = swi_d (DUT), u3 = swi_b, u5 = swi_a; Test Engineer
          bidhanc@bidhanc-dl
Tester:   bench-runner
Graded:   tester
Case:     AWPTCM-T47873, ck.db `zephyr_cases` row 44054, title "VRRP(v3)", folder
