          Three checkable claims, and the case names its own authority:
            (1) configure a basic VRRP per the FOG document;
            (2) end device(s) can be reached when EITHER the master OR the
                backup router loses connection;
            (3) role transitioning works correctly, with no unexpected errors
                or crashes.
          THE NAMED DOCUMENT WAS OBTAINED AND READ: the URL in the step text
          resolves to the VRRP Feature Overview and Configuration Guide,
          C613-22049-00 REV E. Everything attributed to "the guide" below is
          from it. There is no objective and no precondition, and the step names
          no topology, no addresses and no expected output -- those were
