  interface goes down, then the VRRP instance ... moves to an INIT state" --
  confirmed on the device.

  COUNTED LEG V2-backup-down:
    eth3: x10 IP p112 10.38.22.34 -> 224.0.0.18   <-- the DUT still advertising
          x5  ARP-REPLY 10.38.22.36 is-at 00:00:5e:00:01:0a
    eth4: x5  UDP ...:9999 ttl=63   SUBJECT    -- end device still reached
          x5  UDP ...:9997 ttl=63   INSTRUMENT
          x0  UDP ...:9998          CONTROL

  Restored with `no shutdown`; swi_b returned to Backup with
