     came back from a cold boot -- the tracking relationship re-armed, reading
     `Monitored circuit: vlan61, Priority Delta: 120, Status: UP` on its own. And
     persistence is proven by frames ARRIVING at the end device at the one-hop
     TTL, with the control still at 0, not by configuration lines reappearing in
     a `show`.

